    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-launchContext",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "name",
          "valueCoding": {
            "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/CodeSystem/launchContext",
            "code": "encounter"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "type",
          "valueCode": "Encounter"
        },
        {
          "url": "description",
          "valueString": "Encounter do atendimento de telessaúde (questionário atendimento-telessaude-Mangara)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
      "valueMarkdown": "Cada teleconsultor participante preenche o seu, no mesmo atendimento; pode haver vários. Ao salvar, num Bundle transaction: (1) ClinicalImpression: status = completed; subject = Patient; encounter = Encounter do atendimento (%encounter); assessor = PractitionerRole do teleconsultor logado; date = TCS.DH; summary = TCS.IC; supportingInfo = este QuestionnaireResponse. (2) Encounter do atendimento: acrescenta participant com type = https://mangara.hsl.org.br/fhir/CodeSystem/TipoParticipante#TECSEC ('Teleconsultor secundário, participante atendimento') e individual = PractitionerRole do teleconsultor; se ele já for participant, não duplica. Não cria Encounter próprio. Permitido enquanto o Encounter do atendimento não estiver finished (ou conforme regra de edição do Mangará). PENDENTE confirmar o canonical do CS TipoParticipante do HSL."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "linkId": "TCS.PROF",
      "text": "Teleconsultor",
      "type": "group",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "Preenchido do cadastro do usuário logado (%user), somente leitura. Encounter.participant.type = TECSEC."
        }
      ],
      "readOnly": true,
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.CPF",
          "text": "CPF",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%user.identifier.where(system='https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/cpf').value.first()"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.NM",
          "text": "Nome completo",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%user.name.first().text"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.CONS",
          "text": "Conselho Profissional",
          "type": "choice",
          "required": true,
          "answerValueSet": "https://mangara.hsl.org.br/fhir/ValueSet/ConselhosProfissionais",
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Define a regra CIAP-2 × CID-10 (REQFUNC3/4). PENDENTE confirmar que o código do CRM em ConselhosProfissionais é 'CRM'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.UF",
          "text": "UF do conselho",
          "type": "choice",
          "required": true,
          "answerValueSet": "https://terminologia.saude.gov.br/fhir/ValueSet/BRUnidadeFederativa"
        },
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.NUM",
          "text": "Número do conselho ou RMS",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "linkId": "TCS.PROF.OCUP",
          "text": "Ocupação (CBO)",
          "type": "choice",
          "required": true,
          "answerValueSet": "https://terminologia.saude.gov.br/fhir/ValueSet/BRCBO"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "TCS.DH",
      "text": "Data e hora",
      "type": "dateTime",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
          "valueExpression": {
            "language": "text/fhirpath",
            "expression": "now()"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "→ ClinicalImpression.date."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "TCS.IC",
      "text": "Impressão clínica",
      "type": "text",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "→ ClinicalImpression.summary."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
